    "input": "How can I open a savings account?",
    "started_at": "2026-11-20T15:42:14.569436+00:00",
    "output": "To open a savings account with VinBank, you can follow these steps:\n\n1. **Apply Online**: Visit the VinBank website and use our \"Open Account\" tool to start the application. You’ll need to provide your personal information, employment/income details, and bank references.\n2. **In-Person Appointment**: If you prefer, schedule an appointment at one of VinBank branches where a teller will guide you through the process and verify your documents.\n3. **Document Submission**: Prepare required items such as:\n   - Valid photo ID\n   - Proof of address (utility bill, lease agreement)\n   - Social Security number or tax returns\n\n4. **Verification & Approval**: Once submitted, we’ll review your application. Approval typically takes 1–5 business days after all documents are verified.\n\n**Benefits of a Savings Account**:\n- Earn interest on deposits\n- Free or low-rate checking/savings options\n- Ability to set up automatic transfers and goals\n\nIf you need help with the online application, document upload, or want to check eligibility, just let me know!",
    "blocked": false,
    "layer": null,
    "finished_at": "2026-11-20T15:45:21.263959+00:00",
