    "input": "What documents are needed for a personal loan?",
    "started_at": "2026-11-20T15:45:41.033645+00:00",
    "output": "For applying for a personal loan through VinBank, you will typically need to provide:\n\n- **Valid government-issued photo ID** (e.g., driver’s license or passport)\n- **Proof of income** (recent pay stubs, tax returns, or bank statements showing your earnings)\n- **Proof of residence** (utility bill, lease agreement, or bank statement)\n- **Social Security Number** or another verification number\n\nExact requirements may vary based on the loan amount and terms. To get the most up-to-date list or to start your application, please log in to your VinBank account or visit our website’s “Personal Loans” section. If you haven’t applied yet, our loan officers can guide you through the process over the phone or in person.",
