    "input": "How do I report a lost credit card?",
    "started_at": "2026-11-20T15:45:57.993899+00:00",
    "output": "To report a lost credit card with VinBank:\n\n1. **Log in** to your account via the VinBank website or mobile app.\n2. Go to **“Security”** or **“Manage Accounts”** → select **“Report Lost Card.”**\n3. Follow the prompts to file the report, request a new card, and update your contact information.\n\nAlternatively, you can:\n- Call the number listed on the back of your card (or forward it from your current device).\n- Visit a local VinBank branch.\n\nIf you suspect unauthorized use during the investigation, you may want to temporarily restrict your card’s privileges by filing a fraud alert—this is available through the same “Security” menu.\n\nFor immediate assistance, let me know your account details and I’ll guide you further.",
